  "note_rig": "Rig on the model's own hinges (geo px = source x 0.723 + [0, 7.23, 0.5055]): ailerons (outer part 10/11 element) +-25 deg; flaperons (inner element) as roll surfaces +-25 deg at 0.8 roll weight; all-moving stabilators on a lateral spindle at 40% chord, +-25 deg, 0.3 roll; canted twin rudders on their forward-raked hinge lines, +-30 deg; the two 2-D nozzle flap sets (parts 8/9 centre elements) pitch with the elevator, +-20 deg (visual thrust vectoring: the pack's flight model has none); wheel rotors at the model's own centres. No leading-edge flaps: the wing is not split there and the rig has only gear- and airbrake-driven flaps.",
